a/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん！自分で言うのもあれだが大人になったな！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつものショートの方がなんか落ち着くかもしれない..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントを見てると\n雑誌等々、テレビやWebなどチェックしてくれてて嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知出来てないのに知ってくれてるのが嬉しい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたまあやは最近backnumberさんばかり聞いてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｒで共演させて頂いてからもっとハマっちゃいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして今日は乃木坂浪漫のイベントでとある場所にいます～(*'▽'*)♪楽しみっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七瀬まるもかずみんもわかちゅきもかなりん、ひめたん、みさみさ！皆でワクワクしながら待ってます～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日カラオケバトルに出てたろってぃ～たまたま休憩中で皆とテレビ見ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうろってぃーが歌い出した瞬間からいろいろな思いが込み上げてきて泣いちゃったよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホント大好き！歌うますぎる୧⃛(๑⃙⃘◡̈๑⃙⃘)୨⃛\nまあやのなかでは最高の一位です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0019.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスも歌も惹きつける魅力があります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてやっと～学校のテストが終わりました～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テストやリハやら家事等と\n毎日約2時間の睡眠は少ないようだけど、意外と乗り切る事が出来ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆からのコメントで勇気もらったり、無理しないで！って言われて元気でたり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が学校などで全然リハに出れてない時、\n立ち位置など振り付け全部みんなが後から教えてくれて私の分までメモってくれて‥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武道館4日間もう直ぐだ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0024.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安と期待といろいろです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回何かイベントがあると応援に来てくれるファンの方や、\nお花を届けてくれたり、皆のおかげで\n今年は お仕事も増えて充実してました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何年か前の自分からは今の自分は全く想像出来ていなかったです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆の言葉や応援で真っ直ぐ前を向いて進むことができています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年もあと少しです。\n悔いのないよう、全力で、丁寧に\n笑顔を届けたいと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみに武道館に来てくれる人が\n1人でも多くの人が、心に残る、心に響くliveになるようにします！\n遠くまで見るから～！\n目があったら名前を呼んでね～（≧∇≦）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0027.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ！！！\nのぎ英語もクリスマススペシャルです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族も その日は乃木坂をTVで見ながら\n一緒にクリスマスをするみたいです～笑\nチケット外れちゃっていけない！とか用事あっていけないって方の気持ちも背負ってがんばりまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/12/10/3829059/0031.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-18089":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は雨が降ったり止んだり\n不安定なお天気でしたね(；-；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨の日でも元気もりもりなんだ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"晴れの日はもっと元気！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学生の時は、毎日お外で遊んでいたから、雨の日でもレジャーシートを引いて傘をいーっぱい両手にもって\n開いた傘をレジャーシートの上に\n重ねて並べて屋根にしたら、\nその傘の中で友達と\nお話したりお菓子を食べたり\nしていました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なつかしいな～(  ´﹀` )♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/04/22/7756233/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とらじゅん\nひなぱんだ\nみおこあら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして一昨日は個別握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬眠から目覚めた3匹の動物たちは\nどうでしたか？(*¯︶¯*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部にコアラになり\n2部にパンダになり\n3部にトラになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれが1番似合ってたかなー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/04/22/7756233/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめての\nはーふちゅいんてーる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日は3部とも全部動物になっていたので、私服を楽しみにしていた方\nごめんなさい(；-；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が会いに来てくださり\n2.3部は列が途切れることなく\n折り返しもできていたみたいで\n嬉しかったです(灬ºωº灬)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめてきたよー！って方もたくさんいらっしゃって、はじめて来たのに、レーンに入ったら動物園だったよ！って言われて\nちょっとニヤッとしてしまいました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},